{"4907650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Laboratorio de Videojuegos", "steam_appid": 4907650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5021570], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every great video game begins with a great level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes a jump feel satisfying? Why do some levels stay with you forever? How do the best games keep you challenged without becoming frustrating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Game Laboratory</strong> is a unique experience that combines a 3D platformer with a complete level creation toolkit, where every play session brings you one step closer to understanding how video games are designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, experiment, create, and share. Here, you won't just complete levels—you'll learn how to build them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/00435c82c1a67965720f4cb779e97070.poster.avif?t=1786391424\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/00435c82c1a67965720f4cb779e97070.webm?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/00435c82c1a67965720f4cb779e97070.mp4?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels filled with platforms, obstacles, traps, and challenges designed to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different game modes, improve your best times, discover hidden secrets, and overcome increasingly complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/976d54162bdb46544cca630b51403822.poster.avif?t=1786391424\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/976d54162bdb46544cca630b51403822.webm?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/976d54162bdb46544cca630b51403822.mp4?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your ideas to life with a simple and intuitive visual editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels using a wide variety of objects, platforms, enemies, traps, and gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No programming knowledge required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Share</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/42623d9d55155c87cc6542e64cd8fc57.poster.avif?t=1786391424\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/42623d9d55155c87cc6542e64cd8fc57.webm?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/42623d9d55155c87cc6542e64cd8fc57.mp4?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish your levels for other players to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download creations from the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the highest ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll never run out of new content to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Who is this game for?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/4a9712aa7d5e0b1d01ea8e89987eb1e6.poster.avif?t=1786391424\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/4a9712aa7d5e0b1d01ea8e89987eb1e6.webm?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907650/extras/4a9712aa7d5e0b1d01ea8e89987eb1e6.mp4?t=1786391424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Game Laboratory</strong> is designed for both platform game enthusiasts and anyone who has ever dreamed of creating their own game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an experience where creativity and learning come together naturally, allowing you to understand how game designers think while building adventures of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every great video game begins with a great level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes a jump feel satisfying? Why do some levels stay with you forever? How do the best games keep you challenged without becoming frustrating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Video Game Laboratory